{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52934","headline":"饯故人 · 高适","name":"饯故人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祈君辞丹豁（孙疑爲「丹墀」之误），负仗（孙疑爲「杖」字之误）归海隅。\n离庭自萧索，别心何郁纡。\n天高白云断，野旷青山孤。\n欲知肠断处，明月照江湖。\n（〖1〗孙钦善云：「此诗原集缺佚，据敦煌残卷伯三六一九补。\n当作於天宝十一载秋，时在长安。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52934.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52934","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}